When adding new exporters:
    1. Define the exporter.
    2. Define the handler (see other exporters and exporter_common file for more info).
    3. Add the exporter type and applicable file extention(s) to the 'ExportAvailableFormat' enum class in exporter_common file.
    4. Import the exporter and handler to the 'export_stig' module and use the registration method to register the exporter with the default_export_service near the bottom.
    
